      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "A. Motion depends on the chosen frame.\nB. Motion appears the same in every\nframe.\nC. A frame changes the object’s motion.\nD. Some frames simply reveal motion\nbetter.",
